  "id": "section-954",
  "title": "为一九六七年七月卅日《人民日报》社论加的一句话",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-334.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>334)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　团结一致，同心同德，任何强大的敌人，任何困难的环境，都会向我们投降的。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-333.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-335.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
